		  ATI IXP400, ATI SB600, ATI SB700/SP5100, ATI SB800, AMD Hudson-2,
		  AMD ML, AMD CZ, Serverworks OSB4, Serverworks CSB5,
		  Serverworks CSB6, Serverworks HT-1000, Serverworks HT-1100 and
		  SMSC Victory66.
		 

	config PACKAGE_kmod-i2c-pxa
