		help
		 This driver is tested with ITE IT8728 and IT8732 Super I/O chips, and
		   supports the IT8761E, IT8613, IT8620E, and IT8628E Super I/O chips as
		   well.
		 

	config PACKAGE_kmod-gpio-mcp23s08
